0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 710.03 Tm (The OS makes suggestions and drafts, but takes no decisions with legal or similarly significant effects for you) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 695.63 Tm (without human involvement. Publishing, sending and paying only happen on your explicit action.) Tj ET
0.04 0.48 0.22 rg
BT /F2 10.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 673.83 Tm (15. Changes) Tj ET
0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 659.18 Tm (We may change this policy, for example for a new feature or provider. The current version is always at) Tj ET
