BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 579.53 Tm (another regime applies, the following applies alongside the rest of this policy.) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 61.69 561.73 Tm (\267) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 561.73 Tm (We do not sell personal information and do not share it for cross-context behavioural advertising. We never) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 547.33 Tm (have and do not intend to; that is also why there is no 'Do Not Sell or Share' control on our site, because there) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.69 532.93 Tm (is nothing to switch off) Tj ET
BT /F2 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 61.69 517.33 Tm (\267) Tj ET
