0 0 0 rg
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 204.28 Tm (If you have a complaint about how we handle your data, e-mail info@socialnow.nl first. We reply within ten) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 189.88 Tm (working days, with a person, not a form.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.6 Tf 1 0 0 1 56.69 172.08 Tm (If we cannot resolve it together, you can always go to a supervisory authority. In the Netherlands that is the Dutch) Tj ET
